    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῦμα</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύω</span>
		(B)) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>defence, protection</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμὸς φυγάσιν ῥ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					85
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπασι κοινὸν ῥ. δαιμόνων ἕδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					260
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργου ῥ.</span> a tower of
			defence, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				159
			</span></i> (anap.): c. gen. objecti, <i>defence against</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατος] μέγιστον ῥ. τῶν πολλῶν κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					353
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύματα</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηθήματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.136
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύσιον</span>.</div>
